# Corpus downloads — re-fetchable build inputs, not source.
#
# 27MB of WLC XML and 2MB of Strong's are inputs to the importers, not things
# the app ships. The DERIVED table (corpora/hebrew-frequency.json, 172KB) IS
# committed, so a build reproduces without re-downloading the whole Tanakh.
scripts/corpora/wlc/
scripts/corpora/strongs-hebrew-dictionary.js
scripts/corpora/*.xml
scripts/corpora/greek/
